.gitattributes file for a GitHub repository

Handle line endings automatically for text files
text=auto

Explicitly declare text files and normalize line endings
*.c text
*.cpp text
*.h text
*.java text
*.py text
*.js text
*.css text
*.html text
*.md text

Binary files should be treated as binary and not modified
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary

Configure diff behavior for specific files
*.lock -diff
*.min.js -diff
*.min.css -diff

Merge strategies
*.lock merge=ours

Linguist settings for GitHub language detection
*.svg linguist-vendored
*.min.js linguist-generated

End of .gitattributes
